  "id": "holistic-healing",
  "term": "holistic healing",
  "definition": "Holistic healing is an approach that uses whole-person practices, such as yoga, to support mental well-being alongside physical processes like stress, inflammation, and immune function. In this context, it refers to methods intended to reduce anxiety, depression, and stress while helping the body maintain healthier regulation.",
