      "reasons": [
        "The definition states that holistic healing uses “whole-person practices.” The packet only mentions “holistic healing methods, such as yoga” and discusses immune/mental effects; it does not explicitly describe yoga (or holistic healing) as “whole-person practices.”",
        "The definition claims the methods are “intended to reduce anxiety, depression, and stress” and “helping the body maintain healthier regulation.” The packet supports that stress/anxiety/depression are aggravated during COVID-19 and that yoga may alleviate stress and inflammation and reduce risk of immune dysfunction/impaired mental health, but it does not support the specific phrasing that the body “maintain healthier regulation.”"
